WEBVTT

00:16:57.537 --> 00:17:02.186
It can't just come from folks
who are burning themselves out

00:17:02.186 --> 00:17:03.744
in the community.

00:17:03.744 --> 00:17:06.742
They need support. They need help.

00:17:06.742 --> 00:17:08.680
Go back to your city.

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.259
Find those people.

00:17:10.259 --> 00:17:12.976
"You need some help? I'll help you out."

00:17:12.976 --> 00:17:16.180
Find those people. They're there.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:21.537
Bring them together with law enforcement,
the private sector, and the city,

00:17:21.537 --> 00:17:24.400
with the one aim of reducing violence,

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:28.346
but make sure that
that community component is strong.

00:17:28.346 --> 00:17:31.667
Because the old adage
that comes from Burundi is right: